# Optional Eigen BLAS build

BayesLinReg uses Eigen's native dense kernels by default. To allow eligible
Eigen operations to use the BLAS implementation linked to R, install the
source package with:

    R CMD INSTALL --configure-args="--enable-eigen-blas" BayesLinReg

or from R with:

    install.packages(
      "BayesLinReg.tar.gz",
      repos = NULL,
      type = "source",
      configure.args = "--enable-eigen-blas"
    )

The environment variable `BAYESLINREG_USE_EIGEN_BLAS=yes` provides an
equivalent opt-in. An explicit configure argument takes precedence.

Use `blm_build_info()` after installation to report whether Eigen BLAS
delegation was compiled and the BLAS library reported by R.
